---
description: "Audit the {{.Store}} (or a single project) for catalog hygiene: orphans, broken links, untagged docs, stale index entries, hub and document shape, ADR gaps. Read-only."
argument-hint: "[project-slug | blank = whole {{.Store}}] [--deep]"
